{"id":100,"name":"العاديات","transliteration":"Al-'Adiyat","translation":"The Courser","type":"meccan","total_verses":11,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"وَٱلْعَٰدِيَٰتِ ضَبْحًا","emlaei":"والعاديات ضبحا","translation":"By the racers, panting","transliteration":"WaalAAadiyati dabhan"},{"id":2,"text":"فَٱلْمُورِيَٰتِ قَدْحًا","emlaei":"فالموريات قدحا","translation":"And the producers of sparks [when] striking","transliteration":"Faalmooriyati qadhan"},{"id":3,"text":"فَٱلْمُغِيرَٰتِ صُبْحًا","emlaei":"فالمغيرات صبحا","translation":"And the chargers at dawn","transliteration":"Faalmugheerati subhan"},{"id":4,"text":"فَأَثَرْنَ بِهِۦ نَقْعًا","emlaei":"فأثرن به نقعا","translation":"Stirring up thereby [clouds of] dust","transliteration":"Faatharna bihi naqAAan"},{"id":5,"text":"فَوَسَطْنَ بِهِۦ جَمْعًا","emlaei":"فوسطن به جمعا","translation":"Arriving thereby in the center collectively","transliteration":"Fawasatna bihi jamAAan"},{"id":6,"text":"إِنَّ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ لِرَبِّهِۦ لَكَنُودٌ","emlaei":"إن الإنسان لربه لكنود","translation":"Indeed mankind, to his Lord, is ungrateful","transliteration":"Inna alinsana lirabbihi lakanoodun"},{"id":7,"text":"وَإِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ ذَٰلِكَ لَشَهِيدٌ","emlaei":"وإنه على ذلك لشهيد","translation":"And indeed, he is to that a witness","transliteration":"Wainnahu AAala thalika lashaheedun"},{"id":8,"text":"وَإِنَّهُۥ لِحُبِّ ٱلْخَيْرِ لَشَدِيدٌ","emlaei":"وإنه لحب الخير لشديد","translation":"And indeed he is, in love of wealth, intense","transliteration":"Wainnahu lihubbi alkhayri lashadeedun"},{"id":9,"text":"۞ أَفَلَا يَعْلَمُ إِذَا بُعْثِرَ مَا فِى ٱلْقُبُورِ","emlaei":"أفلا يعلم إذا بعثر ما في القبور","translation":"But does he not know that when the contents of the graves are scattered","transliteration":"Afala yaAAlamu itha buAAthira ma fee alquboori"},{"id":10,"text":"وَحُصِّلَ مَا فِى ٱلصُّدُورِ","emlaei":"وحصل ما في الصدور","translation":"And that within the breasts is obtained","transliteration":"Wahussila ma fee alssudoori"},{"id":11,"text":"إِنَّ رَبَّهُم بِهِمْ يَوْمَئِذٍ لَّخَبِيرٌۢ","emlaei":"إن ربهم بهم يومئذ لخبير","translation":"Indeed, their Lord with them, that Day, is [fully] Acquainted","transliteration":"Inna rabbahum bihim yawmaithin lakhabeerun"}]}